<title>PHILIPPINES: Petron up 7.5 pct on fuel supply pact news.</title>
<headline>Petron up 7.5 pct on fuel supply pact news.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petron Corp gained 60 centavos, or 7.5 percent to 8.60 pesos in midsession on news that it bagged a 16-billion peso fuel supply pact from the National Power Corp, brokers said.</p>
</text>
